<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Philip Morris EPS view cut.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Philip Morris EPS view cut.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Morgan Stanley analyst David Adelman on Monday cut his estimate for Philip Morris Cos Inc's 1997 earnings per share (EPS) to $8.85 from $8.95.</p>
<p>-- He also reduced his estimate for 1998 EPS to $10.35 from $10.45.</p>
<p>-- Adelman blamed a stronger dollar for the reductions. The company's stock remains rated a strong buy.</p>
<p>-- Shares in the tobacco and consumer packaged goods company closed on Friday at 113-1/4.</p>
<p>((-- Wall Street desk (212) 859-1730))</p>
</text>
